    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "n1_body",
      "x": 35,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "Intent classification & food item extraction\n· log_food_basic — LOG_FOOD structured data\n· unit_normalization — any unit → grams\n· complex_meal — 1 sentence → 3 items\n· chitchat — conversational → CHITCHAT\n· nonsense — gibberish → CHITCHAT\n· query_daily_stats → QUERY_DAILY_STATS\n· query_food_info → QUERY_FOOD_INFO",
      "originalText": "Intent classification & food item extraction\n· log_food_basic — LOG_FOOD structured data\n· unit_normalization — any unit → grams\n· complex_meal — 1 sentence → 3 items\n· chitchat — conversational → CHITCHAT\n· nonsense — gibberish → CHITCHAT\n· query_daily_stats → QUERY_DAILY_STATS\n· query_food_info → QUERY_FOOD_INFO",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
