    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "n4_body",
      "x": 35,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "DB lookup & LLM estimation paths\n· db_success — food_id → MacroResult\n· db_error — tool error → FAILED result\n· accumulates — appends to existing batch\n· preserves_estimated — source kept from DB\n· pops_pending — removes processed item\n· estimation — no food_id → LLM estimate\n· empty_pending — nothing → empty dict",
      "originalText": "DB lookup & LLM estimation paths\n· db_success — food_id → MacroResult\n· db_error — tool error → FAILED result\n· accumulates — appends to existing batch\n· preserves_estimated — source kept from DB\n· pops_pending — removes processed item\n· estimation — no food_id → LLM estimate\n· empty_pending — nothing → empty dict",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
